ation en-019d9565-55ed-7ed2-b492-3c9405f18d0f points to ecological tournaments and multi-scenario win rates, while en-019d9565-98ac-7f42-9209-faf03adc7cc8 shows enterprise preference for control metrics like rollback frequency and defect escape rate.

